  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>max</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>max</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>max</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;is not continuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;is differentiable in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;is a linear function,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the required option.</p></blockquote>"
